#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# asymptotic_greater

#% text
# `asymptotic_greater(f, g, x -> a)` gives true when g = o(f) as x approaches a: g/f tends to 0.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# It is `asymptotic_less(g, f, x -> a)`, with the same options `direction:` and `assumptions:`.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
asymptotic_greater(x^2, x, x -> inf)
#% output
#= true

#% cell
asymptotic_greater(1/x^2, 1/x, x -> 0)
#% output
#= true

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `asymptotic_less`, `asymptotic_greater_equal`
